<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Survival Hunter DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Ulduar, Naxxramas, Obisidian Sanctum, and Eye of Eternity. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Survival Hunter DPS Phase 2</h2>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit - Aim for 8% Hit Rating, up to 3% of your hit rating can be covered by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=53622/focused-aim">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focused Aim</span></a> and an additional 1% from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> if you are Draenei.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Agility - Agility will increase your ranged attack power and critical strike rating, as well as the benefit of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=34503/expose-weakness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_findweakness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Expose Weakness</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike Rating - Critical Strike Rating will increase your chance to land a critical hit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Attack Power - Attack Power simply increases the damage done by abilities utilizing attack power in the formula.</div></li></ol>
