<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Survival Hunter DPS Phase 2</h3>Depending on your situation and whether or not you raid 25mans or only 10man the order in which you spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a> will differ. If you are only raiding 10man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> then I recommend you purchase Tier 8 Helm and Chest first. On the other hand if you do raid 25mans then purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45820/broach-of-the-wailing-night">
